<!--Post: 7475--><!--Time: 1108511945-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7475"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Iq<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Iq<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, February 15, 2005 - 3:59 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->There have been several times I&#39;ve wanted to find a link that I saw on this site but couldn&#39;t find it.  <BR>I think it would help keep things organized if we could use this thread as a &#34;LINK RESOURCE THREAD&#34;  <BR> <BR>To make finding the link easier please label each with a brief description.  <BR>Any and all links directly related or just interesting coincidence are welcome.  <BR>I&#39;ve seen some links posted as a result of googling key words that turn out to be very interesting.  <BR> <BR>Here are some ideas:  <BR> <BR>BTK related  <BR>-Documents  <BR>-Maps  <BR>-Pictures  <BR>-Timelines  <BR> <BR>Examples:  <BR> <BR>Otero Letter <BR><a href="http://www.catchbtk.com/letters.html" target=_top>http://www.catchbtk.com/letters.html</a> <BR> <BR>Psychic sketches of BTK <BR><a href="http://www.catchbtk.com/images/btk1.jpg" target=_top>http://www.catchbtk.com/images/btk1.jpg</a> <BR><a href="http://www.catchbtk.com/images/btk2.jpg" target=_top>http://www.catchbtk.com/images/btk2.jpg</a> <BR><a href="http://www.catchbtk.com/images/btk3.jpg" target=_top>http://www.catchbtk.com/images/btk3.jpg</a> <BR> <BR>Pat Brown&#39;s Person of Interest <BR><a href="http://www.she-dc.com/pages/BTK.htm" target=_top>http://www.she-dc.com/pages/BTK.htm</a> <BR> <BR>Strange Coincidence?  <BR><a href="http://www.killman.com/" target=_top>www.killman.com/</a>  <BR> <BR> <BR>Interesting old Post Toasties Boxes  <BR><a href="http://www.theimaginaryworld.com/post.html" target=_top>http://www.theimaginaryworld.com/post.html</a>  <BR> <BR>Any help I can get in moving the links already on the site would be appreciated.  <BR> <BR>iq<!--/Text--></td></tr>
