</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Witchking<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 23, 2005 - 10:25 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text--><a href="http://witchkingofangmar.blogspot.com/" target=_top>http://witchkingofangmar.blogspot.com/</a> <BR> <BR>From someone who has had enough of the moollycoddling of this filth and wants to tell him what a real bag of sh&#42;t he is. He&#39;s no legend, I&#39;m going to rewrite the end of this story from the one he has planned for it. <BR> <BR>Visit and let him know what he&#39;s really worth. I&#39;ve been in Wichita 3 days now and find the people engaging and wonderful, sans ONE<!--/Text--></td></tr>
