<!--Post: 8642--><!--Time: 1109260404-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8642"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:witchkingofangmar@comcast.net" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Witchking<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Witchking<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 24, 2005 - 7:53 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Unfortunatley I was asked by someone &#40;whom I shall not name&#41; to take the above site down. It was NOT the hosting company, the request came from someone via email with Wichita PD who asked I call them. I did and spoke with someone there who stated the above mentioned site had drawn the ire of &#39;someone&#39; close to the investigation.  <BR> <BR>I will stay in town looking<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8642-->
<!--Post: 8643--><!--Time: 1109261595-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8643"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Topsailgrl<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Topsailgrl<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 24, 2005 - 8:13 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Well POOP! Witchking! I didnt get to see the site at all! Wish I had a &#39;clue&#39; as to what was posted on it.  <BR> <BR>One can only imagine who&#39;s ire you drew. Please keep us posted, it&#39;s great that you are in a sense taking us along with you on your stay in town.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8643-->
<!--Post: 8645--><!--Time: 1109264304-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8645"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:witchkingofangmar@comcast.net" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Witchking<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Witchking<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 24, 2005 - 8:58 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->My stay has been very nice indeed. My website was basically me challenging BTK and posting of things &#40;such as the fellow using the pay phone off of Harry street the other night who looked strange so I called WPD and the police grabbed him and then dusted the phone booth for prints--didn&#39;t know Wichita had such nice SWAT trucks&#41; I&#39;m finding out locally along with a couple of craaaaazy, shall we say, electronic tricks that have gleaned something of value. <BR>I was a very bold site intended &#40;and I make NO BONES about his&#41; to challenge, intimidate and aggravate a certain piece of filth. It aggravated SOMEONE close to the investigation who saw it, I could guess who but I couldn&#39;t tell you exactly whom. I know who I hope objected to it...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8645-->
<!--Post: 8646--><!--Time: 1109264353-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8646"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 24, 2005 - 8:59 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Be careful ALL!  Witchking...tried to access that site that &#34;drew the ire of someone&#34;....took my whole system down....but all is okay...it took about 20 minutes to get it back up and running...just be careful...someone is of course watching you...watching us... <BR>I just wish I could have seen it also.. <BR>don&#39;t stop posting! <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8646-->
<!--Post: 8648--><!--Time: 1109265679-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8648"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:witchkingofangmar@comcast.net" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Witchking<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Witchking<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 24, 2005 - 9:21 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I won&#39;t stop posting &#40;OR DIGGING&#41;. I don&#39;t claim to know EVERYTHING, that would be a fools errand pretending I did. I do know SOME things and HINTED at them on the website. SOMEONE didn&#39;t like it and I wasn&#39;t told whom but I did oblige even though the thought the Wichita PD have had the case for 31 years and me visiting Wichita and putting up an admittedly tough website and having someone asking to take it down after only 4 days did crank me off a bit. I guess you could say I was being a good guest. It also tells me either BTK or the WPD watch this site as I hadn&#39;t linked it anywhere else yet... <BR> <BR>The overall idea I have still stands, if this piece of filth crosses my path somewhere sometime he&#39;ll have a hard time defending himself in court all Karen Ann Quinlan&#39;d up &#40;Nice 70&#39;s reference for you there BTK&#41;<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8648-->
<!--Post: 8654--><!--Time: 1109268424-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8654"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 24, 2005 - 10:07 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Yea for YOU Witchking...keep right on digging...I am originally from WIchita....very nice people there...very kind and hospitable...there will be sooo many people going &#34;home&#34; when the &#34;filth&#34; is apprehended! <BR>Thank-you for your caring and your digging...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8654-->
<!--Post: 8668--><!--Time: 1109276920-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8668"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lorenap<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lorenap<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 24, 2005 - 12:28 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Witchking, I have a couple of things on my mind.  I live in Wichita now and find it hard to believe &#34;the swat team was called&#34; and &#34;the phone booth dusted for prints&#34; as you say. All of this happened just because someone {you} called the police about someone suspicious looking using a payphone? MMM....don&#39;t think so. We may be in the middle of the big USA but we&#39;re not a bunch of Barney Fife&#39;s running around here saying &#34;Andy!, I think we got &#39;em!. By the way, I DID log on to your website last night and I honestly thought it had to be a joke. Where did you get that god awful picture from? It looked like KKK meets halloween, meets aliens from outer space. If your for REAL, I&#39;d be REAL surprised.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8668-->
<!--Post: 8669--><!--Time: 1109277846-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8669"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:witchkingofangmar@comcast.net" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Witchking<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Witchking<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 24, 2005 - 12:44 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Lorenap, don&#39;t believe me, look at the police logs, evdently they were more interested in WHOM he was calling than me calling him in. Someone I spoke to said he was on the phone with KAKE at the time---investigate that. They indeed had the phone booth dusted for prints. Get a police scanner would be my advice. It just seems strange to me someone is on a payphone constantly looking side to side and somewhat agitated. <BR>I&#39;m very real and the picture is that of the Witch King of Angmar, a character in the Lord of the Rings trilogy, if you&#39;d like the backstory supposedly the Witch King is one no man can kill.... <BR> <BR>If you saw any of the posts originally on the site you&#39;d see I had many KIND things to say about Wichita and that the people were nothing like the cow-town rubes many on the coasts would expect. In fact I said I enjoyed everyone in the town sans ONE. <BR> <BR>Now back to the intended string...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8669-->
<!--Post: 8678--><!--Time: 1109280563-->
