</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Witchking<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 24, 2005 - 3:10 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->they asked and trying to be accomodating, I did but I mentioned in the redone site I reserve the right to change it back... <BR> <BR>It&#39;s amazing the interest I&#39;m getting here. Tom is going to beat us all senseless if we don&#39;t get back on target with this string...If I do get some more info &#40;keep your police scanners on&#41; I will surely pass it along in the correct threads... <BR> <BR>Off to KC Mo in the morning to visit my favorite aunt and uncle....I&#39;ll return sometime soon. Wichita is a very nice place and you can&#39;t beat the steaks! <BR> <BR>peace to all of you, except one<!--/Text--></td></tr>
